class "OmniWGS84LocalPositionAPI" (
    doc = """Defines a local geodetic WGS84 style position represented as (longitude, latitude, altitude).  This position is always
             relative to a reference position defined by the same or parent prim using the OmniGeospatialWGS84ReferencePositionAPI schema.  
             If no prim is defined in the parent hierarchy with a reference position definition, this schema should be ignored.  Otherwise,
             the cartesian position of this prim should be calculated relative to the first reference position in the parent hierarchy.
             
             NOTE: It is undefined to have both a WGS84ReferencePositionAPI and WGSLocalPositionAPI schema applied to the same prim."""
